{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal","id":1196390,"title":"Mage 2E / Signs of Sorcery problem - No sharing Paths Mage Sight between cabal","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-16T23:47:26-07:00","id":1196390,"title":"Mage 2E / Signs of Sorcery problem - No sharing Paths Mage Sight between cabal","content":"I take subtopic out of <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196185-aedes-and-boons-new-signs-of-sorcery-spoilers\">Aedes and Boons thread</a>, based on new <b>Signs of Sorcery </b>preview. It just pointed me to one major problem I have with <b>Mage</b> 2E rules as collaborative gameplay experience that should be fixed in <b>SoS </b>materials at print. In a nutshell, Aedes are special places of power in Supernal World that only one Path can see and explore as Mystery. They are very intriguing and fun to run - but can only be perceived and interacted with BY ONE PATH of mages. That means that in typical players cabal it will be one, maybe two players that can dwell only to Mystery that should story - for <b><i>whole players table</i></b> <b>- be part of.</b> Hermit pointed it better:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196185-aedes-and-boons-new-signs-of-sorcery-spoilers?p=1196332#post1196332\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Only the hacker can interact with the system, while others are doing things outside the computer stuff. The hacker may face firewalls while hacking, while others may face external complications while the hacker is doing his stuff, both introduced by the Storyteller.<br /> <br /> Only the Path-corresponding mage can interact with the Aedes, while others are doing things outside the Supernal stuff. The Path\u2019s mage may face Supernal entities while Mage Sight-ing, while others may face external complications while the mage is doing his stuff, both introduced by the Storyteller.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>The problem is that in Collaborative Investigative RPG <b>Mage</b> 2E is - in it's core rules and setting engine - dwelling into Mystery should be part of <b>all players</b>, not only 1/5th of them. </i></span><br /> <br /> You should not have scene where only one of five players is doing all Cool Stuff and rest just waits for him to wait. And No, throwing split combat for others is not always solution for something that is 'day-to-day' players experience - like observing and Scrutinizing Mysteries.<br /> <br /> I was pointed that Prime 4 spell <i>'Apocalypse'</i> is solution to the problem - it shares casters Mage Sight to other people, mages included. But for me it's not solution to the problem with <b>most basic and fundamental mechanics of the 2E game</b>. I will not grant every player Prime 4 on start just to solve this. All of them using some Imbued items is also to conveying ( and what number, 5 Items per character? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).<br /> <br /> <u><b>ESPECIALLY, as it should simply be in-build possibility for all players, too make table cooperative storytelling of Mystery possible.</b></u> In my point of view, it's a bug in all the gameline politics to make <b>Mage</b> 2E clearly investigative game - if it's Investigation genere, <b><i>all cabal members</i></b> should be possible to pursue the same Mysteries, simple like that. With now rules, you need to make some story hacks that should simply work from the first game session.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T00:21:46-07:00","id":1196399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal#post1196390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You should not have scene where only one of five players is doing all Cool Stuff and rest just waits for him to wait. And No, throwing split combat for others is not always solution for something that is 'day-to-day' players experience - like observing and Scrutinizing Mysteries.<br /> <br /> I was pointed that Prime 4 spell <i>'Apocalypse'</i> is solution to the problem - it shares casters Mage Sight to other people, mages included. But for me it's not solution to the problem with <b>most basic and fundamental mechanics of the 2E game</b>. I will not grant every player Prime 4 on start just to solve this. All of them using some Imbued items is also to conveying ( and what number, 5 Items per character? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).<br /> <br /> <u><b>ESPECIALLY, as it should simply be in-build possibility for all players, too make table cooperative storytelling of Mystery possible.</b></u> In my point of view, it's a bug in all the gameline politics to make <b>Mage</b> 2E clearly investigative game - if it's Investigation genere, <b><i>all cabal members</i></b> should be possible to pursue the same Mysteries, simple like that. With now rules, you need to make some story hacks that should simply work from the first game session.</div> </div> </div> </div>What you're conveying here is that you aren't willing to give individual players scenes where what they're doing is the focus and/or divide the cabal's attention and placement across separate locations and perspectives, and also that you're unwilling to make use of the workarounds necessary for that to be a viable mode of play for dealing with Mysteries that represent specific perspectives in a game where every major PC-template-sharing character is developing their own personal approach to the Mysteries.<br /> <br /> This is not exposing a flaw in the game. Every Mage character is capable of picking up four dots in Prime without special tutelage, Aedes are uncommon elements in the Supernal Worlds of their Paths, and not every mage is obligated to hold the same interest in every Mystery \u2014 part of the point of players tending to specialize their character roles is so that they <i>don't</i> all have to be equally capable of investigating every line of inquiry, and characters with the resources of a Sect at their disposal can generally afford to split their group efforts while one of them looks deeply into a specific symbolic entity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T00:29:43-07:00","id":1196400,"title":"","content":"Eh, not sure it's such a big deal.<br /> <br /> Just like the summoning of a Supernal entity, it's an opportunity for one player to shine, enjoying a part of their Mage Sight/their Path that others aren't privy to.<br /> <br /> And even if it is a problem, borrow an Apocalypse imbued item and cast it on all of your Cabal. One item borrowed from the stores, problem solved. And that is just if the rest of your party isn't happy to just stand by and let the one+ Mage of the appropriate Path deal with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12644,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","user":"HerbertIsBestBert","date":". 03-17-2018, 03:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T01:04:01-07:00","id":1196410,"title":"","content":"There's a spell to share your Sight with another mage in Signs of Sorcery. Apocalypse is for giving a <i>non</i>-mage Mage Sight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T01:22:22-07:00","id":1196413,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a spell to share your Sight with another mage in Signs of Sorcery. Apocalypse is for giving a <i>non</i>-mage Mage Sight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apocalypse does still work on mages and specifically grants the Sight of the caster's Path, while Shared Sight as previewed specifically doesn't change the Path-based context of the target's Mage Sight \u2014 Wyrd's issue stems from the fact that Aedes can only be perceived by the Sight of specific Paths, which is why Apocalypse is what people are pointing to. Has Shared Sight changed in its particulars since it was last shown?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:02:04-07:00","id":1196424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's a spell to share your Sight with another mage in Signs of Sorcery. Apocalypse is for giving a <i>non</i>-mage Mage Sight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe it's been changed since the one we've seen, but the Shared Sight spell that was posted in the blog post shares the Arcanum, such that &quot;Mages still perceive granted Arcana under their own Path, not the Path of the caster&quot;.<br /> <br /> I assume that's been changed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:31:21-07:00","id":1196432,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196413#post1196413\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apocalypse does still work on mages and specifically grants the Sight of the caster's Path, while Shared Sight as previewed specifically doesn't change the Path-based context of the target's Mage Sight \u2014 Wyrd's issue stems from the fact that Aedes can only be perceived by the Sight of specific Paths, which is why Apocalypse is what people are pointing to. Has Shared Sight changed in its particulars since it was last shown?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Exactly</i> what I looking for - way to share ones Path Mage Sight to other Awakened character, on the start of Arcanum progression.<br /> <br /> Maybe <b>DaveB</b> will show now version of<i> Shared Sight</i> spell to let share players Mage Sight across Paths - we will see. For now I just answer arguments risen here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196399#post1196399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What you're conveying here is that you aren't willing to give individual players scenes where what they're doing is the focus and/or divide the cabal's attention and placement across separate locations and perspectives,</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I do not like to constantly split game party - we run one story to run one plot. I'm not against doing this from time to time, if there is some good reason. But when I would need to run parallel Mage Sight scenes for all mages is cabal, as a typical, 'day-to-day' scene run for Awakened - it's too much and unnecessary. There simply be rules for granting your Sight to other mages, early in Arcana levels - is it Attainment or Spell it's not really a difference for the larger problem<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196399#post1196399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and also that you're unwilling to make use of the workarounds necessary for that to be a viable mode of play for dealing with Mysteries that represent specific perspectives in a game where every major PC-template-sharing character is developing their own personal approach to the Mysteries.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is 'personal approach' - and there is, in reality, running game as series of interconnected 1on1's between solo player and ST. Personal Approach things are reflected in character Obsessions or Legacy - not day-to-day gameplay experience. If most basic thing PCs do - i.e. Mystery Scrutiny under Paths Supernal Realm - needs to make 1on1, every time they declare action - <b>it's a problem </b>with collaborative gameplay of whole team.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196399#post1196399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Every Mage character is capable of picking up four dots in Prime without special tutelage,</div> </div> </div> </div>After my last run with <b>Mage</b> 2E I will be <i>very</i> couscious to give any player ANY Arcanum 4th dot, not too mention giving Prime 4 for free to everyone. It's not viable solution on game where 4th dot of Arcanum makes you literal killing machine.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196399#post1196399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aedes are uncommon elements in the Supernal Worlds of their Paths</div> </div> </div> </div>If I'm - as ST - making Aedes main Mystery to the story at hand, I want <i>all</i> players to see and interact with it - not only 1/5th of the team. Once again - running RPG you strive to not make session into series of 1on1's.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196399#post1196399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">not every mage is obligated to hold the same interest in every Mystery \u2014 part of the point of players tending to specialize their character roles is so that they <i>don't</i> all have to be equally capable of investigating every line of inquiry, and characters with the resources of a Sect at their disposal can generally afford to split their group efforts while one of them looks deeply into a specific symbolic entity.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is difference with 'My PCs Obsessions are Abyss and XVII century poetry' and 'As ST I want to run a story about Aedes, for whole players to experience'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-17-2018, 06:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:38:42-07:00","id":1196435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal#post1196390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But for me it's not solution to the problem with <b>most basic and fundamental mechanics of the 2E game</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK.... I get the idea that a Mystery that's Path exclusive without specific spells isn't necessarily a great idea for many groups.<br /> <br /> But how is this a problem with a basic and fundamental mechanic? Aedes are a weird unique Mystery that keys off of something linked to Paths, it doesn't demonstrate anything other than Aedes might not work for some groups because of how they're structured. It doesn't expose a fundamental issue with Mage Sight, or a fundamental issue with Mysteries so... what's the big deal? It's a cool thing from a supplement that may or may not be fun to introduce to every game?<br /> <br /> Or am I missing something?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:45:49-07:00","id":1196437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196432#post1196432\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">After my last run with <b>Mage</b> 2E I will be <i>very</i> couscious to give any player ANY Arcanum 4th dot, not too mention giving Prime 4 for free to everyone. It's viable not solution on game where 4th dot of Arcanum makes you literal killing machine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also... for all this talk about collaboration, I find the phrasing of, &quot;give any player ANY Arcanaum 4th dot,&quot; to be strange. Last time I checked Mage doesn't have a giant, &quot;you can't buy Gnosis and Arcana dots without the ST's explicit permission,&quot; sign. If a player wants the 4th dot and has satisfied the system requirements to get it... I think collaboration demands a lot more than, &quot;I as the ST say no,&quot; regarding whether it should happen.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There is difference with 'My PCs Obsessions are Abyss and XVII century poetry' and 'As ST I want to run a story about Aedes, for whole players to experience'. </div> </div> </div>Aedes don't seem to be the right Mystery for this intent? They're either things that fall into the more personal side, or things that should go to higher level games where sharing Mage Sight including Path is something that's not onerous to achieve. Or just, you know, house rule Aedes somehow if you really like them and don't want to give it all to one player; though I'm having trouble seeing when you'd really need to do this over a Supernal Verge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T03:45:58-07:00","id":1196438,"title":"","content":"Problem is that all Supernal Mysteries are large part of <b>Mage</b>. You want to talk to Supernal Entity in nearby - watch corresponding Path's Mage Sight. Look for Verge of particular Realm - watch corresponding Path's Mage Sight. Looks for the Aedes that is local Mystery for Awakened community - watch corresponding Path's Mage Sight. I will not be surprised if for looking for particular Abyssal Ziggurat realm you also would need to have corresponding Path's Mage Sight.<br /> <br /> In <b>Signs of Sorcery</b> we will get 10 new Supernal Mysteries templates in the point of various Aedes - Why do I need to have only one Path all cabal members to running them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T04:37:50-07:00","id":1196446,"title":"","content":"You don't, we've already shared that you can just borrow an item that is at most a 2-dot Imbued Item to perceive using a different Path.<br /> Heck, make it an AoE version that moves with the item, and you only need to use 1 Mana a pop to grant the entire Cabal a specific Path's sight.<br /> <br /> Sure that might not be the one that your specific Aede is native to, but I wouldn't imagine 2-dot items are too rare, especially ones as useful as those than grant other Mage Sights, and if any Mage in the Cabal knows Prime 1, then they can just cast the spell themselves.<br /> <br /> There are solutions, easily accessible ones.<br /> <br /> Heck, just give them the merits for free if you want to run an Aede based story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12644-herbertisbestbert","name":"HerbertIsBestBert","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12644_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"312"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T05:26:21-07:00","id":1196452,"title":"","content":"It's fixing myself the thing that should be good in first place from the start of 2E Mage gameline - i.e. to run group Mystery Scrutiny in multi-Paths cabal ( that is most common for PCs groups, from my over 12 years <b>MtAw</b> experiance ). That's why I raised topic. 'House rule everything' is not solution to the most often problem of the gameline. I will see how <i>Shared Sight</i> spell will end in <b>SoS</b> then - if it will solve multiPath cabals problem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-17-2018, 08:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T06:11:39-07:00","id":1196456,"title":"","content":"If they don't suit your group, then you could just not use them as core mysteries, leave them as background elements. In fact, how often are you expecting to use an Aede as a core mystery? I mean, if it's not often, then you could just build the plot around obtaining the imbued items to allow the group to participate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T06:55:36-07:00","id":1196464,"title":"","content":"I <i>literally</i> <b>right now</b> planing the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1191993-creation-of-free-council-equality-as-mystery?p=1196443#post1196443\">19th century game around Aedes popping-up</a> - that just come very handy for the Mystery answer for previous plot idea - and I plan to use a lot of Supernal stuff in my games. And no, I will not restrict the game only for ( possible ) Mastigos characters. Just not sharing Paths Mage Sight in collaborative investigation game about mages - is stupid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T07:49:46-07:00","id":1196482,"title":"","content":"Are you actually paying attention to the easy solutions that have been offered?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T07:53:58-07:00","id":1196484,"title":"","content":"Okay, why can't you just start the plot by obtaining the imbued items needed to allow the group to participate?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T08:52:34-07:00","id":1196501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196484#post1196484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, why can't you just start the plot by obtaining the imbued items needed to allow the group to participate?</div> </div> </div> </div>( Talking about 2E gamelines design... )<br /> <br /> Why <i>should</i> I need to obtain Imbued Item for the most basic games plot to work in cabal, in the first place? CoD games are <i>groups</i> storytelling games, don't they.<br /> <br /> Do I need special items to make Sacred Hunt in <b>Werewolf</b>? No, just a Rite that <i>any</i> ( Uratha ) character can have from the start - for 'free'.<br /> <br /> Do I need special items for <b>Beast</b> broods to explore Chambers in Dream? No, they just do it collectively - for <b>free</b>.<br /> <br /> Do I need special powers in <b>Promethean</b> to share alchemical powers and help one another in Pilgrimage? No, they just make Alchemical Pact. ( Items just makes it better, slight. )<br /> <br /> <b>You see here? Any 2E gameline <i>helps</i> do it's 'Game Main Groups Activity' to share between player characters. </b><br /> <br /> Only Awakened in 2E cannot share the Mage Sight and we end with running 5 different 1on1's in typical group - or have only one character access on general to ones Supernal Realm related Mysteries, like with Aedes example. WHY it need to be this way? Other games simply let you simply share 'Game Main Groups Activity'. In <b>Mage</b> 2E you do some weird and totally unnecessary hacks to let it work. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-17-2018, 11:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T09:49:30-07:00","id":1196514,"title":"","content":"The Aedes are not supposed to be the main game group activity, they are supposed to be some Supernal weirdness that you can include if you feel like it.<br /> <br /> The reason that you need to get an item or a dude with Prime is to engage in the -other- main part of the game, which is the social aspect of it. This is another way to make it so being in an Order matters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T10:05:07-07:00","id":1196519,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196501#post1196501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why <i>should</i> I need to obtain Imbued Item for the most basic games plot to work in cabal, in the first place? CoD games are <i>groups</i> storytelling games, don't they.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's something to do.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Only Awakened in 2E cannot share the Mage Sight and we end with running 5 different 1on1's in typical group - or have only one character access on general to ones Supernal Realm related Mysteries, like with Aedes example. WHY it need to be this way? </div> </div> </div>It means you have to co-operate. You each see different things, so you have to work together.<br /> <br /> Thing is, shared mage-sight isn't going to fix your problem. I mean, your players are presumably still going to use their own mage sight most of the time, no?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T10:59:24-07:00","id":1196536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196185-aedes-and-boons-new-signs-of-sorcery-spoilers?p=1196352#post1196352\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Thing is, shared mage-sight isn't going to fix your problem. I mean, your players are presumably still going to use their own mage sight most of the time, no?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why they would use other 'deep' Mage Sight? It will show EXACTLY the same, in diffrent Symbols, on general things. And other Paths Sights WILL NOT show Mysteries related to only one Supernal Realm, like Aedes example. So why spamming diffrent Paths Sights? <br /> <br /> Also, sharing one Path Sight is for all players to interact with same Mystery. As it is now, 4/5th of muliPath cabal simply cannot INTERACT with Mysteries of particular Path, like Aedes. Normally, players seeing that needed Demon of Pandemonium is in Pandemonium Sight - they will gladly let they Mastigos cast Share Sight on them. And when we talk about cooperation - players still need to talk over and combine their Mana to cast larger spell on whole cabal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T13:28:00-07:00","id":1196580,"title":"","content":"What the what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T17:30:04-07:00","id":1196654,"title":"","content":"I still think it won't end up being <i>that </i>big of a problem, wyrd. I mean, this won't be the first time something in a game can only be realistically approached by certain characters, and it won't be the first time the Storyteller will have to work the plot so that others have something to do, often by introducing social structures within the world so that other characters can gain limited access to the normally limited gameplay element, and it certainly will never be the first time you'll have to talk with you players whether they're all okay with the game's direction.<br /> <br /> So... relax and wait for a bit until we get the full picture?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T17:40:40-07:00","id":1196658,"title":"","content":"Not every player has access to all potential setting elements. If anything, it a basis for player cooperation and creativity.<br /> <br /> To me, the complaint that not all Paths can interact with all Aedes is it little different that complaints that not all mages can use every Arcanum or that a particular Inferior Arcanum is too limiting.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T17:49:07-07:00","id":1196661,"title":"","content":"Having a Mystery that can only be seen by specific player characters is a great way to shine the spotlight on that character, especially if you use it as a key to a greater Mystery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T18:43:49-07:00","id":1196676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196661#post1196661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having a Mystery that can only be seen by specific player characters is a great way to shine the spotlight on that character, especially if you use it as a key to a greater Mystery.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Particularly when it only requires Prime 2 to share Mage Sight among mages. That's hardly a significant barrier or impediment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T18:48:58-07:00","id":1196679,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196501#post1196501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why <i>should</i> I need to obtain Imbued Item for the most basic games plot to work in cabal, in the first place?</div> </div> </div> </div>Turning what's clearly meant to be a Mystery of the Week and/or a cool place to build your Sanctum around into the central plot device of a whole chronicle is NOT &quot;the most basic games plot,&quot; and as the one doing it anyway it's on you to not leave half the cabal out in the cold.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Do I need special items to make Sacred Hunt in <b>Werewolf</b>? No, just a Rite that <i>any</i> ( Uratha ) character can have from the start - for 'free'. </div> </div> </div>If your prey is in Twilight and the ritemaster wasn't a Bone Shadow you're gonna have a bad time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T21:46:14-07:00","id":1196714,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196654#post1196654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I still think it won't end up being <i>that </i>big of a problem, wyrd. I mean, this won't be the first time something in a game can only be realistically approached by certain characters, and it won't be the first time the Storyteller will have to work the plot so that others have something to do, often by introducing social structures within the world so that other characters can gain limited access to the normally limited gameplay element, and it certainly will never be the first time you'll have to talk with you players whether they're all okay with the game's direction.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I mentioned before - there is difference in 'you need to homebrew or made possible some exotic stuff' - and doing collaborative experience of heart and soul of the game. In <b>Mage</b> example, it's looking over (Supernal) Mysteries. It's, basically, limiting 4/5th of the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T21:50:15-07:00","id":1196715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196658#post1196658\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not every player has access to all potential setting elements. If anything, it a basis for player cooperation and creativity.<br /> <br /> To me, the complaint that not all Paths can interact with all Aedes is it little different that complaints that not all mages can use every Arcanum or that a particular Inferior Arcanum is too limiting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Difference there is big. In Arcanum it's 'I cannot use all the powers in the scene'. In Aedes ( and other related Path problems ) it's 'I cannot <b>partake</b> in plot scene'. It's obvious <i>needless</i> <i>exclusion</i> <i>of players </i>on main premise of the game. Not powergaming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T21:58:55-07:00","id":1196718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196661#post1196661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Having a Mystery that can only be seen by specific player characters is a great way to shine the spotlight on that character, especially if you use it as a key to a greater Mystery.</div> </div> </div> </div><b>And making Mystery accessible and interactive with only 1/5th of Awakened population is <i>bad for setting</i></b>. If we made central Mystery of the Consilium, for example, one Aedes - only members of that Path can see and interact with it. No other Path members will want to see it, as they cannot even start to. And they have their own Mysteries to dwell to. So this particular Consilium should be made of only one Path that is tied to Supernal Mystery at hand, as only they will want to stay.<br /> <br /> Now, if there is rather simple mechanics for sharing Path's Sight to other mages - and no, Prime 4 spell is not 'rather simple mechanics' in this category - other Path mages can come to Consilium and ask local 'proper' Path mages to share a Sight with them, so they can expiriance it also and dwell in to Mystery. <b>Local Consilium then is much more Path diverse and we have mages <i>more interactive and working together</i> in Orders than before hard ban of only yours Mage Sight.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T22:01:16-07:00","id":1196719,"title":"","content":"Please stop projecting yourself onto the game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I call the Integrity-analogue the &quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/822559-trying-to-understand-the-morality-system?p=825008#post825008\" target=\"_blank\">subjective stat</a>&quot;.<br /> An explanation how to <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/913221-using-social-manuevering\" target=\"_blank\">use Social Manuevering</a>.<br /> Guanxi Explanations: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=787824#post787824\" target=\"_blank\">1</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/787518-the-mysterium-and-their-contribution-to-mage-society?p=788173#post788173\" target=\"_blank\">2</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/833863-mages-and-trading-favors?p=834531#post834531\" target=\"_blank\">3</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2758-errol216","name":"Errol216","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T22:10:42-07:00","id":1196720,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196676#post1196676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Particularly when it only requires Prime 2 to share Mage Sight among mages. That's hardly a significant barrier or impediment.</div> </div> </div> </div>Last I check <i>Apocalypse</i> spell was Prime 4 in 2E <b>MtAw </b>corebook. Or do you mean <i>Shared Sight </i>spell from<b> Signs of Sorcery</b><i> that is not working as I talk here</i> - i.e. it does not share casters Path Sight, only it's Arcana? I hope it will be fixed in final text. IF Shared Sight will work with sharing Path's Sight, then I will be content - I would simply make it Any Arcanum <b>\u2022 </b>spell, but I understand whole idea is in basics of Prime as preview. And giving players Prime 1 for free at start is <i>totally different</i> thing - in positive way - than giving them dozens of Imbued Items or Prime 4 on start. <br /> <br /> For ease of referance, version of spell that was previewed to us. Underline part of it I have problem with.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Shared Sight </i>(Prime \u2022)</b><br /> <b>Practice: </b>Unveiling Primary<br /> <b>Factor: </b>Duration <br /> <b><i>Cost:</i></b> 1+ Mana (see below) <br /> <b>Withstand: </b>Resolve <br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills: </b>Expression, Investigation, Occult <br /> Few mages have even a rudimentary understanding of all the Supernal Mysteries, but mages often find it useful to pool their investigative efforts. This spell grants the subject, who must be a mage or under the influence of the Prime \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 spell <i>Apocalypse</i> (Mage p. 169), Prime mage Sight. <u>Mages still perceive granted Arcana under their own Path, not the Path of the caster.</u> This spell costs 1 Mana per Arcanum per subject, unless the additional Arcanum is one of the caster's Ruling Arcana.<br /> <br /> <b>Add Any Other Arcanum \u2022:</b> Instead of or as well as Prime Sight, the spell may grant Mage Sight in the included Arcanum. Including multiple Arcana allows the spell to grant Mage Sight in a number of Arcana equal to the spell's Potency, so long as any Mana cost is paid.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T22:18:01-07:00","id":1196722,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196679#post1196679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Turning what's clearly meant to be a Mystery of the Week and/or a cool place to build your Sanctum around into the central plot device of a whole chronicle is NOT &quot;the most basic games plot,&quot; and as the one doing it anyway it's on you to not leave half the cabal out in the cold.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I pointed before - my newest chronicle idea aligns perfectly with Aedes as idea. It will be game where PCs will look for few of those, in span of decades. Will probably have Aedes of all Paths in this scenario. It still does not change a problem that on each story only one player will interact with particular Aedes. Sharing Supernal interactions between Paths is <i>good</i> for the game.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196679#post1196679\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If your prey is in Twilight and the ritemaster wasn't a Bone Shadow you're gonna have a bad time.</div> </div> </div> </div>And you still can go out and look for Bone Shadow ritemaster that will bless YOU to kill the Twillight Prey, not borrow Fetishes from him. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's a big differenace between 'we did it!' and 'special magical item of Elder Zeo did it'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Letting share Path Sight will let you still to come to your's Orders members of the Path and 'ask for blessing'.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T22:42:43-07:00","id":1196725,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196718#post1196718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>And making Mystery accessible and interactive with only 1/5th of Awakened population is <i>bad for setting</i></b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>The best thing about &quot;Mysteries&quot; is that Mystery is a label for all the weird uncategorized off the map stuff Mages are obsessed with. Quite a few can only be seen by particular Arcana according to the core rulebook, which means that every starting Mage is going to be unable to see any Mystery whose effects fall under the 7 Arcana they don't have dots in.<br /> <br /> Giving the paths their own private Mysteries is less of a leap than you're imagining. I like anything that hammers home the unique perspective each path provides beyond the respective expertise with particular arcana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":61,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","user":"Octavo","date":". 03-18-2018, 01:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-17T22:42:59-07:00","id":1196726,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196722#post1196722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And you still can go out and look for Bone Shadow ritemaster that will bless YOU to kill the Twillight Prey, not borrow Fetishes from him. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's a big differenace between 'we did it!' and 'special magical item of Elder Zeo did it'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Letting share Path Sight will let you still to come to your's Orders members of the Path and 'ask for blessing'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wyrd? Wyrd I want you to listen to me very closely:<br /> <br /> <i>This is exactly what having a character with Prime 4 and an appropriate Path cast Apocalypse with long Duration on your cabal of mages already does. There is literally no relevant difference between this and finding a Bone Shadow ritemaster to bless your werewolf pack's Sacred Hunt on a murderous ghost. You are drawing a completely arbitrary distinction here.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T02:46:38-07:00","id":1196755,"title":"","content":"I haven't gone through the whole thread yet (and I'm going to, because I'll have a longer response coming when I'm home), so I'm sorry if this has come up already.<br /> <br /> Did you even ask your players what they think?<br /> <br /> If you're afraid of revealing plots to them but are worried they'll react poorly this might just be a good time to talk metagame. Or maybe you just shouldn't build a plot around a premise you aren't on board with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T05:03:18-07:00","id":1196767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196714#post1196714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Like I mentioned before - there is difference in 'you need to homebrew or made possible some exotic stuff' - and doing collaborative experience of heart and soul of the game. In <b>Mage</b> example, it's looking over (Supernal) Mysteries. It's, basically, limiting 4/5th of the game.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So, your table has a play/Storytelling style. Got it.<br /> <br /> This element of the game isn't going to fit it. Also pretty clear by now.<br /> <br /> People are saying how there are ways around the issue as it currently stands, and that your interpretation of How The Setting Is isn't actually an objective truth. But you prefer to keep the latter instead of the former. Okay, cool. You're the Storyteller, right? As long as other players agree, sure.<br /> <br /> So... can't you just, you know, not use Aedes then? I'm generally perplexed as to why you are giving this part of the setting so much prominence when you don't want to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T05:54:33-07:00","id":1196770,"title":"","content":"I see we have gotten from molehill to mountain. Again.<br /> <br /> Actually, one interesting thing that\u2019s been mentioned though is the possibility of a consilium dominated by a single Path. I think other Paths will certainly find a way to get in on the action, but it would be interesting to explore them being at a natural disadvantage in engagement and numbers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T08:34:36-07:00","id":1196808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196726#post1196726\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wyrd? Wyrd I want you to listen to me very closely:<br /> <br /> <i>This is exactly what having a character with Prime 4 and an appropriate Path cast Apocalypse with long Duration on your cabal of mages already does. There is literally no relevant difference between this and finding a Bone Shadow ritemaster to bless your werewolf pack's Sacred Hunt on a murderous ghost. You are drawing a completely arbitrary distinction here.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Oh no, no, no - there is one, badass difference here. <b>Sacred Hunt Rite is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1047667-2e-should-not-sacred-hunt-be-inner-ability?p=1048135#post1048135\">'almost free' for starting characters ( as I was pointed by WtF devs )</a>, Prime 4 is literally one step before total control over Magic itself.</b> It's like saying that summoning 10 dan martial arts master is solution to some goons attacking you on the street. For Bone Shadow Sacred Hunt there is very high percentage that your packs players will have it. If not - you are almost sure is that one other Bone Shadow in local werewolf community will have this Rite, as it's so 'free' and basic.<br /> <br /> Prime 4 is not near to that. In future games I want to limit characters with 4th dot of any Arcanum - and highly question will give it for players, even in later arcs of game.<br /> <br /> And I mentioned few post above - IF <i>Shared Sight</i> spell shared Path's Sight on Prime 1 I will gladly embrace it. Prime 1 entry level for Paths Sharing is <b>totally different matter</b> than Prime 4.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-18-2018, 12:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T08:51:23-07:00","id":1196813,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196808#post1196808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Prime 4 is not near to that. In future games I want to limit characters with 4th dot of any Arcanum - and highly question will give it for players, even in later arcs of game.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, house ruling mage sight to your specifications is terrible, but house ruling arcana is fine?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T09:09:43-07:00","id":1196820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196813#post1196813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, house ruling mage sight to your specifications is terrible, but house ruling arcana is fine?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not house ruling Arcana - it's limiting numbers of characters having higher levels in general Awakened population. Numbers we still do not have for canon. IF character will earn 4th dot - she can do what she wants. It's just those mages will be small number. Surely not 'I can borrow Prime 4 from ANYONE I met' kind a thing many of you assume in setting, as I see the tone of posts here.<br /> <br /> And, remember, that <b>DaveB</b> pointed that <i>Shared Sight</i> spell is solution that is even easier than Imbued Items. Let's just make sure it solves a problem and not just miss it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T09:13:22-07:00","id":1196823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196808#post1196808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh no, no, no - there is one, badass difference here. <b>Sacred Hunt Rite is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1047667-2e-should-not-sacred-hunt-be-inner-ability?p=1048135#post1048135\">'almost free' for starting characters ( as I was pointed by WtF devs )</a>, Prime 4 is literally one step before total control over Magic itself.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>This difference is meaningless regarding going to find an NPC to do the magic for you. NPCs aren't limited by what's free for starting level characters. Getting Prime 4 isn't even that expensive for a Prime focused character from any Path (getting to Gnosis 3 or 4 is a bigger deal than getting to Prime 4, XP-wise, it's 35 XP total for a character that starts at Gnosis 1, Prime 0, so we're not talking some massive XP NPC dump either).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's like saying that summoning 10 dan martial arts master is solution to some goons attacking you on the street. </div> </div> </div>No, because you're not asking for a master to come in and solve the conflict for you, you're asking for a NPC to open the path to the conflict for you.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> In future games I want to limit characters with 4th dot of any Arcanum... </div> </div> </div>Then stop blaming the game for not interacting well with your house rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":617,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","user":"Heavy Arms","date":".  Math correction. 03-18-2018, 02:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T09:22:50-07:00","id":1196826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196820#post1196820\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's not house ruling Arcana - it's limiting numbers of characters having higher levels in general Awakened population. Numbers we still do not have for canon. IF character will earn 4th dot - she can do what she wants. It's just those mages will be small number. Surely not 'I can borrow Prime 4 from ANYONE I met' kind a thing many of you assume in setting, as I see the tone of posts here.</div> </div> </div> </div>You specifically mentioned limiting players.<br /> <br /> Also, it doesn't really matter either way. The rarer Prime Adepts are, the more story you have, it's pretty obvious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T12:34:20-07:00","id":1196875,"title":"","content":"Also the more likely that people who do have Prime 4 will be commissioned to make things of that level because they\u2019re going to be in s real jam if something happens to that guy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T12:59:22-07:00","id":1196883,"title":"","content":"Dave's earlier post implies that a mage wanting to share his Mage Sight with another mage requires less than Prime 4, despite the language in Apocalypse.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> There's a spell to share your Sight with another mage in Signs of Sorcery. Apocalypse is for giving a <i>non</i>-mage Mage Sight. </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410\"> Mage 2E / Signs of Sorcery problem - No sharing Paths Mage Sight between cabal - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196410#post1196410 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> I take subtopic out of Aedes and Boons thread (http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196185-aedes-and-boons-new-signs-of-sorcery-spoilers), based on new Signs of Sorcery preview. It just pointed me to one major problem I have with Mage 2E rules as collaborative gameplay experience that should be fixed in SoS materials at print. In a nutshell, Aedes are special places of power in Supernal World that only one Path can see and explore as Mystery. They are very intriguing and fun to run - but can only be perceived and interacted with BY </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/618-branford","name":"branford","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar618_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1904"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T14:51:07-07:00","id":1196910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196823#post1196823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, because you're not asking for a master to come in and solve the conflict for you, you're asking for a NPC to open the path to the conflict for you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Further, this lets you require the PCs to owe a debt or perform a later favor - in short, <i>more</i> plot hooks. How is this a bad thing?<br /> <br /> EDIT: Ninja'd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T15:22:06-07:00","id":1196919,"title":"","content":"A Weaving spell should be more than enough to alter the Mage Sight of someone who already has it. Maybe even just a Ruling one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T18:32:25-07:00","id":1196987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196808#post1196808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh no, no, no - there is one, badass difference here. <b>Sacred Hunt Rite is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1047667-2e-should-not-sacred-hunt-be-inner-ability?p=1048135#post1048135\">'almost free' for starting characters ( as I was pointed by WtF devs )</a>, Prime 4 is literally one step before total control over Magic itself.</b> It's like saying that summoning 10 dan martial arts master is solution to some goons attacking you on the street. For Bone Shadow Sacred Hunt there is very high percentage that your packs players will have it. If not - you are almost sure is that one other Bone Shadow in local werewolf community will have this Rite, as it's so 'free' and basic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Any character who starts the game in a Sect has enough Order Status to requisition a one-dot Mentor for the story; a one-dot Mentor who is a mage serving in the role to a Gnosis 1 character with six Arcanum dots is entirely capable of being an Adept of Prime per the guidelines.<br /> <br /> A lack of a character who can mess with Mage Sight in a setting where you intend for characters to investigate a Mage-Sight-specific Mystery without specializing their characters toward a particular concept, meanwhile, is not something mandated by the game itself. <i>That is something you put there yourself</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T21:44:19-07:00","id":1197033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196987#post1196987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any character who starts the game in a Sect has enough Order Status to requisition a one-dot Mentor for the story; a one-dot Mentor who is a mage serving in the role to a Gnosis 1 character with six Arcanum dots is entirely capable of being an Adept of Prime per the guidelines.<br /> <br /> A lack of a character who can mess with Mage Sight in a setting where you intend for characters to investigate a Mage-Sight-specific Mystery without specializing their characters toward a particular concept, meanwhile, is not something mandated by the game itself. <i>That is something you put there yourself</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>I just do not want Adepts flying all around in the game now. <i>Especially</i> as the game I plan is about Nameless in Nameless War, so no Global Orders 'you just need to go to other town chapter house of our' on players side. Much more street-level, punk game.<br /> <br /> In the end, I will hack <i>Shared Sigh </i>spell from Prime 1 if it will stay as it is in text. But I do hope that <b>DaveB</b> look on this topic in book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-18T21:49:56-07:00","id":1197036,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar414_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"414\" data-vbnamecard=\"414\">Gallus</a> there is proposed spell for sharing Mage Sigh between mages in <b>SoS</b> previews. But - for now at least - it does not share Path's Sight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196720#post1196720\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For ease of referance, version of spell that was previewed to us. Underline part of it I have problem with.<br /> <br /> <b><i>Shared Sight </i>(Prime \u2022)</b><br /> <b>Practice: </b>Unveiling Primary<br /> <b>Factor: </b>Duration<br /> <b><i>Cost:</i></b> 1+ Mana (see below)<br /> <b>Withstand: </b>Resolve<br /> <b>Suggested Rote Skills: </b>Expression, Investigation, Occult<br /> Few mages have even a rudimentary understanding of all the Supernal Mysteries, but mages often find it useful to pool their investigative efforts. This spell grants the subject, who must be a mage or under the influence of the Prime \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 spell <i>Apocalypse</i> (Mage p. 169), Prime mage Sight. <u>Mages still perceive granted Arcana under their own Path, not the Path of the caster.</u> This spell costs 1 Mana per Arcanum per subject, unless the additional Arcanum is one of the caster's Ruling Arcana.<br /> <br /> <b>Add Any Other Arcanum \u2022:</b> Instead of or as well as Prime Sight, the spell may grant Mage Sight in the included Arcanum. Including multiple Arcana allows the spell to grant Mage Sight in a number of Arcana equal to the spell's Potency, so long as any Mana cost is paid.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T03:05:31-07:00","id":1197101,"title":"","content":"Creative Thaumaturgy! Just make it a Weaving Spell that transforms one Path's Sight into another Path's Sight. If the book comes out and the Spell works differently you can just retcon it. Your players won't burn you at the stake, will they?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T03:14:57-07:00","id":1197103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197033#post1197033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just do not want Adepts flying all around in the game now. <i>Especially</i> as the game I plan is about Nameless in Nameless War, so no Global Orders 'you just need to go to other town chapter house of our' on players side.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again though, this is just you picking to do things in a fashion that's fighting itself. You're picking a central Mystery that normal starting PCs would struggle to be able to handle as a group, and constantly removing all the things in the game put there that would create in-play avenues of addressing this.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Much more street-level, punk game. </div> </div> </div>Completely serious:<br /> <br /> How the hell are Aedes a good central Mystery for a street-level punk game; even more so one about Nameless mages during Nameless War?<br /> <br /> Regardless of any mechanical points, this is such a tonal miss-match it boggles my mind. It's like saying you want to run a game about exploring the depths of the realms of the Fallen World, but the central Mystery is if you can tell vampire Clans apart by the odor of their socks.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T03:20:11-07:00","id":1197108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197103#post1197103\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How the hell are Aedes a good central Mystery for a street-level punk game; even more so one about Nameless mages during Nameless War?</div> </div> </div> </div>It points on what you mean by the punk game. In my POV it's about fighting with establishment ( Nameless vs Global Orders ), expending your own 'truth' ( maybe connecting to general Truth of game universe ), without backing of global structures ( one again, Nameless without Global Orders ). Finding Aedes pointing to the ideas of equality sounds a bit punk to me this way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-19-2018, 06:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T03:25:33-07:00","id":1197110,"title":"","content":"You do realize that other Mages of the same Path will also be able to see the Aedes right? If it\u2019s so damn convincing it can create the FC then why don\u2019t all the Mages from the Path that can see it get converted to the FC?<br /> <br /> Heavy Arms and Satchel right though, you\u2019re making your problems and getting in your own way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T03:57:52-07:00","id":1197120,"title":"","content":"Another possibility is to just steal those imbued items they need, I mean it's a Nameless <i>War </i>after all. You don't even need there to be tons of Adepts in the present; the Orders have been around for a few thousand years.<br /> <br /> That could even give the Diamond a bit of a decaying feel to them. They dominate because they have this inheritance of magic that they can't really recreate.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197110#post1197110\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it\u2019s so damn convincing it can create the FC then why don\u2019t all the Mages from the Path that can see it get converted to the FC?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, they said 'pointing to'. I don't see many Diamond Mages rushing to overturn their whole society because of what an Aede <i>might</i> imply.<br /> <br /> Indeed, if the Nameless are going to use their ambiguous interpretations to attack the Diamond, it's a good excuse for the Diamond to try and take control of them (at least to cordon them off).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T06:27:02-07:00","id":1197162,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197108#post1197108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It points on what you mean by the punk game. In my POV it's about fighting with establishment ( Nameless vs Global Orders ), expending your own 'truth' ( maybe connecting to general Truth of game universe ), without backing of global structures ( one again, Nameless without Global Orders ). Finding Aedes pointing to the ideas of equality sounds a bit punk to me this way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just make a custom Supernal mystery that can be seen only in the mage sight regardless of path (or arcanum). While the specific textual aedes in the corebook (thorns, mandalas, ecstasies, shells, etc) are divided up by path, the point of Mysteries is that they defy categorization, but can be investigated by the mystic senses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T07:48:16-07:00","id":1197190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197036#post1197036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar414_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"414\" data-vbnamecard=\"414\">Gallus</a> there is proposed spell for sharing Mage Sigh between mages in <b>SoS</b> previews. But - for now at least - it does not share Path's Sight. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You are not limited in what spells can do based on a &quot;published&quot; spell, you are limited by the Practices. Changing a mage's Path Sight is <i>at most</i> a Weaving effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":414,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","user":"Gallus","date":". 03-19-2018, 11:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T17:51:55-07:00","id":1197408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197162#post1197162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just make a custom Supernal mystery that can be seen only in the mage sight regardless of path (or arcanum). While the specific textual aedes in the corebook (thorns, mandalas, ecstasies, shells, etc) are divided up by path, the point of Mysteries is that they defy categorization, but can be investigated by the mystic senses.</div> </div> </div> </div>Of all the solutions in this thread this is the one I'd choose to use.<br /> <br /> I still think wyrdhamster would say the way Aedes as written are bad game design, though, even with the great plot hook above. That really boggles my mind because most gamers want character niche protected, not homogenized or obliterated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T18:10:25-07:00","id":1197416,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197408#post1197408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That really boggles my mind because most gamers want character niche protected, not homogenized or obliterated.</div> </div> </div> </div>Players definitely, STs who haven't mastered pacing and revolving spotlight not so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T18:30:07-07:00","id":1197421,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1196808#post1196808\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh no, no, no - there is one, badass difference here. [B]Sacred Hunt Rite is <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1047667-2e-should-not-sacred-hunt-be-inner-ability?p=1048135#post1048135\">'almost free' for starting characters ( as I was pointed by WtF devs )</a>-*snip*</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, the best part of you referencing that post is that illustrates how firmly and soundly <i>you tend to ignore clear and obvious answers in favor of your own problems</i>.<br /> <br /> Maybe after all this time of having people smack their head in response to this trend, maybe it's time you seriously start considering that you're approaching these games and role-playing in general from the wrong direction instead of assuming that people just don't get it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T18:55:26-07:00","id":1197435,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197108#post1197108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It points on what you mean by the punk game.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't see how. Especially with the talk of &quot;street-level&quot; stuff added in. Nothing about &quot;fighting the establishment&quot; or &quot;[expanding] your own truth,&quot; as aspects of a &quot;punk&quot; themed game seem supported by Aedes in what you're saying at all.<br /> <br /> An Aedes could be used to fight the establishment if the specific Aedes happens to be useful for your fight, but that doesn't make the Aedes a central mystery, because resolving it becomes a stepping stone towards resolving the central conflict of fighting the establishment; esp. if there's more than one of them to study<br /> <br /> An Aedes seems less, &quot;expanding your own truth,&quot; then more individual and Fallen World focused Mysteries can accomplish. Studying any Mystery in Mage does mean expanding yourself in some fashion, but I don't get anything particularly punk for the specifics of an Aedes, and if anything quite the opposite. Aedes are all about expansion by interacting with Supernal truths via specific expressions of the Supernal in the Aedes' &quot;terrain&quot; as the Supernal entity residing there (and easier summoning). You're going to commune with as aspect of Supernal truth rather than actualizing Supernal truth through yourself.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Finding Aedes pointing to the ideas of equality sounds a bit punk to me this way. </div> </div> </div>An Aedes of that theme doesn't sound punk to me in any specific way.<br /> <br /> Frankly, the whole pitch for your game sounds fun... but it makes me think of the Wonder Woman movie, but you're playing Steve Trevor and his crew as mages that by chance stumble across an Aetheric Aedes (Themyscira), and actually end up studying the Mystery of the Supernal Entity the lives there (Diana) going out into the world even though that really shouldn't work (which gets around the need for Path specific Mage Sight pretty quickly). Sure the movie's set a few decades late for a Nameless War game, but it sounds like the same general idea (and there's plenty of 19th Century wars that could be changed to be the back drop instead) and it is hardly what I'd call &quot;street level&quot; or &quot;punk.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T19:30:05-07:00","id":1197452,"title":"","content":"I think the fact that it was a spoiler for Aedes that suddenly made you <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> suddenly think you had a perfect hook for your next chronicle should be taken as a red flag. This is a pretty consistent pattern with you. The next new shiny thing you see always ends up being &quot;perfect&quot; for your next chronicle, but also always ends up having inherent problems that you can't work your way around to create an actual chronicle. Then you end up creating a bunch of threads asking the rest of us how to resolve your problems, which are artificially put in place by -you.- When we try to helpfully tell you that you're coming at it from the wrong perspective, or how to approach your own idea better you end up telling the rest of us that we're in the wrong. It's a frustrating pattern of behavior on your part.<br /> <br /> On the positive side, you being consistently in the wrong and stubborn about it has made me consider the game from a really amazing number of angles which hardly ever vindicate your stance but does give me a deeper level of appreciation for the game as is. So, thanks for that I guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T20:03:31-07:00","id":1197457,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197452#post1197452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the fact that it was a spoiler for Aedes that suddenly made you <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1437_5.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1437\" data-vbnamecard=\"1437\">wyrdhamster</a> suddenly think you had a perfect hook for your next chronicle should be taken as a red flag. This is a pretty consistent pattern with you. The next new shiny thing you see always ends up being &quot;perfect&quot; for your next chronicle, but also always ends up having inherent problems that you can't work your way around to create an actual chronicle. Then you end up creating a bunch of threads asking the rest of us how to resolve your problems, which are artificially put in place by -you.- When we try to helpfully tell you that you're coming at it from the wrong perspective, or how to approach your own idea better you end up telling the rest of us that we're in the wrong. It's a frustrating pattern of behavior on your part.<br /> <br /> On the positive side, you being consistently in the wrong and stubborn about it has made me consider the game from a really amazing number of angles which hardly ever vindicate your stance but does give me a deeper level of appreciation for the game as is. So, thanks for that I guess.</div> </div> </div> </div>I used to be there with you on the positive, but I'm running out of appreciation for the way that these conversations force me into greater mastery, being perfectly honest.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-19T20:30:27-07:00","id":1197467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197457#post1197457\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I used to be there with you on the positive, but I'm running out of appreciation for the way that these conversations force me into greater mastery, being perfectly honest.</div> </div> </div> </div>Makes me wonder if we should adopt RPG.net's + and - threads.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage