ly posted by <strong>branford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1196390-mage-2e-signs-of-sorcery-problem-no-sharing-paths-mage-sight-between-cabal?p=1197772#post1197772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Reading some threads on rpg.net often reveal &quot;bad actor&quot; is often defined as little more than someone who does not agree with the majority, without requiring anything really &quot;bad&quot; by the understanding of most people. There's a lot of group-think on rpg.net, and it's sometimes eerie.</div> </div> </div> </div>*Shrugs* I will leave that speculation to others. But in the case of Onyx path related games there were specific issues related to material and bad actors that is well documented. And as at least one of those actors are banned both here and elsewhere so I am not going to say more on the matter. Also this is not the place to air your grievances about other forums.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2997,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/","user":"Guest","date":". 03-20-2018, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-20T16:44:04-07:00","id":1197784,"title":"","content":"Maybe this entire discussion has wandered into territory that it shouldn't? It is starting to feel like some of theses responses are dangerously close to becoming passive-agressive attacks on Wyrd.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></s